# fixture: aca-partial-first-year  (adversarial)
#
# a plan that starts in October. Its first tax year holds three months, so
# it is settled against the card's estimate rather than a MAGI the plan only
# part-saw. Only 80% of the credit is advanced, so the return pays the rest.
# 2027 is advanced on the estimate again, because 2026 was not a full year
# on the marketplace; 2028 renews on 2027.

